OL,3,GNEWSAArtist creates cars filled with
OL,4,Awater to show tide
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art installation made up of cars
OL,7,Ffilled with water has been created to
OL,8,Fillustrate the rise and fall of the
OL,9,Ftide.
OL,11,FArtist David Cotterrell has repurposed
OL,12,Ffour old Ford Fiestas and filled them
OL,13,Fwith water, the level of which will
OL,14,Frise and fall in response to tidal
OL,15,Finformation in Plymouth.
OL,17,FHe said: "There's something wonderfully
OL,18,Fstrange about encountering an ordinary
OL,19,Fcar and realising that it is quietly
OL,20,Fresponding to the sea."
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
