OL,3,GNEWSAArtist creates cars filled with
OL,4,Awater to show tide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cars will be on display at Tinside
OL,7,FLido, Mount Batten, Tavistock Place and
OL,8,FMount Edgcumbe from Thursday, before
OL,9,Fthey are moved to other parts of the
OL,10,Fcity during September and October.
